# Three lobbies, three addresses, one page.
#
# The tier is a property of a lobby, not a document, so /lobbies/beg and its
# siblings rewrite onto the one lobbies page with a tier filter rather than
# standing up three copies of a 3,000-line file to drift apart. 200 rewrites
# rather than redirects, so the address the player shares is the address they
# keep in the bar.
#
# These are a convenience for linking and navigation only. What a player may
# actually enter is decided server-side in POST /api/lobbies/join, which is
# the one gate a typed URL cannot walk around.

/lobbies/beg   /lobbies.html?tier=BEG   200
/lobbies/int   /lobbies.html?tier=INT   200
/lobbies/adv   /lobbies.html?tier=ADV   200
